  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Civic and Political Strengthening Activity (CAPs): the activity will have three main objectives: 1. Citizens increasingly understand and play their civic roles. 2. Women and youths political engagement strengthened. 3. Political representation, competition, and accountability enhanced.</narrative>
